  "question": {
    "text": "If the coefficient of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>13</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;and the&nbsp;coefficient of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>13</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;are equal, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is equal to:&nbsp;"
  },
  "options": [
