  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p>The coefficient of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;in the expansion of&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>13</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;equal to the coefficient of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>13</mn></msup></math>.</p><p>We know that, the general term&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> in the expansion <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup></math>&nbsp; is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mi>r</mi></msup></math></p><p>Applying to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>13</mn></msup></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>13</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>13</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>r</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>r</mi></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>13</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mrow><mn>13</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mrow><mn>13</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mfenced><mi>b</mi></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Therefore,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>13</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;for coefficient of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>7</mn></msup></math>.</p><p>Thus,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>13</mn></mmultiscripts><mfenced><mfrac><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>11</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p>Similarly, applying to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>13</mn></msup></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>13</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>13</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mi>r</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>13</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mrow><mn>13</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mrow><mn>13</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mfenced><mi>b</mi></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Therefore,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>13</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;for&nbsp;coefficient of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>7</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>6</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>13</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mn>7</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mi>b</mi></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Hence, applying the given condition we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>13</mn></mmultiscripts><mfenced><mfrac><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>11</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>6</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>13</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mn>7</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mi>b</mi></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>6</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>13</mn></mmultiscripts><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>13</mn></mmultiscripts></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>13</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>13</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>22</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
}